        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F93BOW, Ornate Bowman Dummy Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSchlage's ornate Bowman handleset features old world detailing on both pieces of the handleset. From the urn tip atop the deadbolt to the fanciful rings on the handle's mounts, this oval-shaped single cylinder handleset is steeped in traditional beauty. It is available in bright brass, lifetime bright brass, and antique brass finishes and will fit standard door preparations. This product is just for looks. It does not lock or latch. It is most often used as a pull to match trim on the inactive side of a double door. It is crafted out of solid brass and features a very easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Cylinder Handleset:</b> Just for looks, it is used on inactive doors and does not function. Does not latch or lock.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available matching: <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/bowman-single-cylinder-handleset-schlage-f60bow\"><b>Bowman Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a><br>\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Bowman Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Guaranteed to fit all standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>3 designer finishes to match any home's architectural style.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Dummy Bowman Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Outside Handle Length: 11-3/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Handle Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Deadbolt Plate Length: 4-2/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Deadbolt Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Top Handle Plate Length: 5-1/10\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Top Handle Plate Width: 2-9/10\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Handle Plate Length: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Bottom Handle Plate Width: 2-2/5\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Bowman Dummy Handleset, Schlage F93BOW",
                "description": "Bowman Dummy Handlset Schlage F93BOW - Schlage's ornate Bowman handleset features old world detailing on both pieces of the handleset. From the urn tip atop the deadbolt to the fanciful rings on the handle's mounts, this oval-shaped dummy handleset is steeped in traditional beauty. It is available in Bright Brass, Lifetime Bright Brass, and Antique Brass finishes. This product is just for looks. It does not lock or latch. It is most often used as a pull to match trim on the inactive side of a double door. It is crafted out of solid brass and features a very easy installation.",
